      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRECIOUS GLOW (1) is an honest type in the frame at four of eight starts including three wins, the latest scoring (25.38) over 450m at Grafton. Strike rate this distance strong having won two of four tries. Has the inside draw and looks tough to beat. ALL ON KYLIE (2) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw then burst clear to score (22.86) at this track in a Grade 5 over 401m. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Should feature again. AUTUMN BOY (3) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing eighth (23.55) at this track. Better than last start and can bounce back. RAMSET READY (5) impressed in her quick 22.75 win last time. Looks an each way chance.",
